# GSDSTD

Standard Library for GSD

### TODO

Planned to Contain:

- string.c -> String functions
- fmt.c -> String Formatting 
- alloc/sba.c -> Slab Buddy Allocator (Custom Algorithm by Grayson)
- alloc/bump.c -> Bump Allocator 
- intrf.c -> Interface Routines 
- thread.c -> Thread Routines 
- time.c -> Time Routines
- floatmath.c -> IEE 754 Math 

## Planned Headers 

- gsdstring.h 
- gsdalloc.h
- gsdtype.h
- gsdintrf.h
- gsdthread.h
- gsdtime.h
- gsdenv.h
- gsdfloatmath.h
- gsdtime.h


Will be Builtin to the kernel and a Libc wrapper will be made so it can be used with the existing C standard for non GSD systems 

